  "name": "Fix AI models not updating on global settings save",
  "pinned": false,
  "description": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Issue Identified**: Global settings changes were not being reflected in the project store's AI models configuration.\n\n2. **Root Cause**: The `saveSettings` method in `GlobalSettings.vue` called `reloadProject()` but didn't properly reinitialize the project's AI models state.\n\n3. **Solution Implemented**: Added a proper reload sequence that synchronizes global settings \u2192 all projects \u2192 active project with updated AI model configurations.\n\n4. **Key Changes**: Modified `saveSettings` to load settings, reload all projects, and reinitialize the active project's AI state after saving.\n\n5. **Result**: Global AI model settings now properly propagate to the active project store, ensuring consistent model configuration across the application.",
